How?

842
00:51:42.773 --> 00:51:43.898
Did you kill her?

843
00:51:44.523 --> 00:51:45.398
Accident.

844
00:51:45.607 --> 00:51:46.857
What accident?

845
00:51:47.440 --> 00:51:48.398
Car accident.

846
00:51:50.315 --> 00:51:52.732
