847
00:51:52.857 --> 00:51:53.898
Then...

848
00:51:54.482 --> 00:51:55.607
Ambulance!

849
00:51:55.773 --> 00:51:57.940
The ambulance driver
must have seen her.

850
00:51:58.065 --> 00:51:59.523
So... are you the guy

851
00:51:59.857 --> 00:52:04.107
