1007
01:07:28.898 --> 01:07:30.065
Hurry up.

1008
01:07:32.898 --> 01:07:33.690
Girl.

1009
01:07:42.315 --> 01:07:43.107
Read what's written.

1010
01:07:43.482 --> 01:07:45.148
Ronny and Alisha!

1011
01:08:22.940 --> 01:08:25.232
Who is controlling everybody?

1012
01:08:27.648 --> 01:08:29.898
